### Description
<!-- A description of the bug or feature -->
There is an issue in function SyncImageSettings in MagickCore/image.c. The issue is similar to https://bugs.chromium.org/p/oss-fuzz/issues/detail?id=6385 which was fixed in https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/56a19e7ae07f40299f3afd4994d690f2c9b81993. 

